<span data-as="p">Fields: <code>repo</code> (required), <code>ref</code> (optional: branch or tag), <code>path</code> (optional: subdirectory)</span>
<span data-as="p">The <code>&quot;acme-corp/*&quot;</code> form is an owner wildcard that matches every repository under that GitHub owner. Owner wildcards require Claude Code v2.1.223 or later. Claude Code accepts them only in <code>strictKnownMarketplaces</code> and <code>blockedMarketplaces</code>. Everywhere else a <code>github</code> source appears, such as <code>extraKnownMarketplaces</code> or <code>/plugin marketplace add</code>, the <code>repo</code> value must name a single repository. For the matching rules, see <a href="#owner-wildcards" class="link">Owner wildcards</a>.</span>
<ol start="2">
<li><strong>Git repositories</strong>:</li>
</ol>
