<span data-as="p">Fields: <code>pathPattern</code> (required: regex pattern matched against the <code>path</code> field of <code>file</code> and <code>directory</code> sources)</span>
<span data-as="p">Use path pattern matching to allow filesystem-based marketplaces alongside <code>hostPattern</code> restrictions for network sources. Set <code>&quot;.*&quot;</code> to allow all local paths, or a narrower pattern to restrict to specific directories.</span>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Configuration examples</strong>:</span>
