figure Claude Code with global and project-level settings, and environment variables.\",\"keywords\":[\"settings.json\",\"settings\",\"config\",\"configuration\",\".claude/settings\",\"worktree\"],\"href\":\"/en/settings\"},{\"sidebarTitle\":\"Permissions\",\"title\":\"Configure permissions\",\"description\":\"Control what Claude Code can access and do with fine-grained permission rules, modes, and managed policies.\",\"keywords\":[\"permissions\",\"allow\",\"deny\",\"allowlist\",\"permission rules\"],\"href\":\"/en/permissions\"},{\"title\":\"Choose a sandbox environment\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Sandbox environments\",\"description\":\"Compare Claude Code sandbox options: the built-in sandboxed Bash tool, sandbox runtime, dev containers, Docker, and VMs. Choose the right isolation for your threat model.\",\"keywords\":[\"sandbox\",\"isolation\",\"dev container\",\"devcontainer\",\"docker\",\"container\",\"vm\",\"virtual machine\",\"bubblewrap\",\"seatbelt\",\"security\",\"dangerously-skip-permissions\",\"bypassPermissions\",\"yolo\",\"yolo mode\"],\"href\":\"/en/sandbox-environments\"},{\"title\":\"Configure the sandboxed Bash tool\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Bash sandbox\",\"description\":\"Learn how Claude Code's sandboxed Bash tool provides filesystem and network isolation for safer, more autonomous agent execution.\",\"href\":\"/en/sandboxing\"}]},{\"group\":\"Environments\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Configure cloud environments\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Cloud environments\",\"description\":\"Configure cloud environments for Claude Code cloud sessions: network access levels, environment variables, setup scripts, and environment caching.\",\"href\":\"/en/cloud-environments\"},{\"group\":\"Self-hosted environments\",\"root\":{\"title\":\"Self-hosted environments\",\"description\":\"Run Claude Code cloud sessions on infrastructure you control: set up a self-hosted environment, deploy runners, and route sessions to your own compute.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"bring your own compute\",\"cloud sessions\",\"remote sessions\",\"enterprise\",\"Kubernetes\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments\"},\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Self-hosted environments quickstart\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Quickstart\",\"description\":\"Set up your first self-hosted environment: install Claude Code, create the environment, start a runner, and route a session to it.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"quickstart\",\"setup\",\"environment secret\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-quickstart\"},{\"title\":\"Deploy self-hosted environments to production\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Deploy to production\",\"description\":\"Run self-hosted runners in production: security hardening, network egress control, git credentials, Kubernetes and Compose recipes, and troubleshooting.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"production\",\"security\",\"egress\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Docker Compose\",\"troubleshooting\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-deploy\"},{\"title\":\"Customize sessions in self-hosted environments\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Customize sessions\",\"description\":\"Customize self-hosted environment sessions with wrapper scripts for per-session credentials, lifecycle hooks, and on-demand runner spawning.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"wrapper script\",\"lifecycle hooks\",\"checkout hook\",\"post-session hook\",\"on-demand runners\",\"spawn-runner\",\"MCP\",\"permissions\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-configuration\"},{\"title\":\"Test self-hosted environments end to end\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Test end to end\",\"description\":\"Verify a self-hosted runner image from CI: dispatch a session with the CLI, read Claude's replies through a Stop hook, and script the full loop.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"CI\",\"smoke test\",\"end-to-end test\",\"dispatch\",\"--environment\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-testing\"},{\"title\":\"Self-hosted environments reference\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Reference\",\"description\":\"Complete reference for the self-hosted runner and orchestrator: CLI flags, environment variables, and Prometheus metrics.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"CLI flags\",\"environment variables\",\"telemetry\",\"Prometheus\",\"metrics\",\"healthz\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Verify session identity in self-hosted environments\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Session identity\",\"description\":\"Verify the CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ACCESS_TOKEN JWT so services on your network can trust requests from sessions in your self-hosted environment.\",\"keywords\":[\"self-hosted environment\",\"self-hosted runner\",\"session token\",\"session access token\",\"JWT\",\"JWKS\",\"CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ACCESS_TOKEN\",\"workload identity\",\"token exchange\"],\"href\":\"/en/self-hosted-environments-identity\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Model and responses\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Model configuration\",\"description\":\"Configure which model Claude Code uses, effort levels, extended context, and the auto-compact window\",\"keywords\":[\"model\",\"opus\",\"sonnet\",\"haiku\",\"fable\",\"opusplan\",\"change model\",\"/model\",\"thinking\",\"extended thinking\",\"ultrathink\",\"effort\",\"fallback\",\"org default\",\"role default\",\"organization model restrictions\",\"effort limits\",\"autocompact\",\"auto-compact window\",\"context window\",\"compaction\",\"CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW\"],\"href\":\"/en/model-config\"},{\"title\":\"Speed up responses with fast mode\",\"description\":\"Get faster Opus responses in Claude Code by toggling fast mode.\",\"href\":\"/en/fast-mode\"},{\"title\":\"Escalate hard decisions with the advisor tool\",\"description\":\"Pair your main model with a stronger advisor model that Claude consults at key moments during a task.\",\"href\":\"/en/advisor\"},{\"title\":\"Output styles\",\"description\":\"Adapt Claude Code for uses beyond software engineering\",\"href\":\"/en/output-styles\"}]},{\"group\":\"Interface\",\"pages\":[{\"sidebarTitle\":\"Terminal configuration\",\"title\":\"Configure your terminal for Claude Code\",\"description\":\"Fix Shift+Enter for newlines, get a terminal bell when Claude finishes, configure tmux, match the color theme, and enable Vim mode in the Claude Code CLI.\",\"keywords\":[\"shift enter\",\"newline\",\"multiline\",\"terminal bell\",\"notification sound\",\"tmux\",\"iterm2\",\"vscode terminal\",\"ghostty\",\"kitty\",\"warp\",\"windows terminal\",\"git bash\",\"mintty\",\"backspace\",\"ctrl+h\",\"vim mode\",\"option key\",\"meta key\",\"flicker\",\"fullscreen\",\"/terminal-setup\"],\"href\":\"/en/terminal-config\"},{\"title\":\"Fullscreen rendering\",\"description\":\"Enable a smoother, flicker-free rendering mode with mouse support and stable memory usage in long conversations.\",\"href\":\"/en/fullscreen\"},{\"title\":\"Use Claude Code with a screen reader\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Screen reader mode\",\"description\":\"Set up Claude Code for screen readers such as VoiceOver and NVDA, plus settings for screen magnifiers, reduced motion, and colorblind-friendly themes.\",\"keywords\":[\"screen reader\",\"screenreader\",\"accessibility\",\"a11y\",\"VoiceOver\",\"NVDA\",\"Orca\",\"JAWS\",\"blind\",\"low vision\",\"screen magnifier\",\"magnifier\",\"zoom\",\"reduced motion\",\"colorblind\",\"daltonized\",\"high contrast\",\"terminal bell\",\"assistive technology\",\"ax-screen-reader\"],\"href\":\"/en/accessibility\"},{\"title\":\"Voice dictation\",\"description\":\"Speak your prompts in the Claude Code CLI with hold-to-record or tap-to-record voice dictation.\",\"href\":\"/en/voice-dictation\"},{\"title\":\"Customize your status line\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Customize status line\",\"description\":\"Configure a custom status bar to monitor context window usage, costs, and git status in Claude Code\",\"href\":\"/en/statusline\"},{\"title\":\"Customize keyboard shortcuts\",\"description\":\"Customize keyboard shortcuts in Claude Code with a keybindings configuration file.\",\"href\":\"/en/keybindings\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Reference\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Reference\",\"href\":\"/en/cli-reference\"}]},{\"tab\":\"Agent SDK\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Agent SDK\",\"href\":\"/en/agent-sdk/overview\"}]},{\"tab\":\"What's New\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"What's New\",\"href\":\"/en/whats-new\"}]},{\"tab\":\"Resources\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Resources\",\"href\":\"/en/legal-and-compliance\"}]}]},{\"language\":\"fr\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"fr\",\"href\":\"/fr/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"de\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"de\",\"href\":\"/de/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"it\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"it\",\"href\":\"/it/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"jp\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"jp\",\"href\":\"/ja/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"es\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"es\",\"href\":\"/es/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"ko\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"ko\",\"href\":\"/ko/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"cn\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"cn\",\"href\":\"/zh-CN/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"zh-Hant\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"zh-Hant\",\"href\":\"/zh-TW/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"ru\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"ru\",\"href\":\"/ru/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"id\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"id\",\"href\":\"/id/settings\"}]},{\"language\":\"pt-BR\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"pt-BR\",\"href\":\"/pt/settings\"}]}]},\"maps\":{\"firstHrefInVersion\":{},\"firstHrefInLanguage\":{\"en\":{\"href\":\"/en/settings\",\"matchLevel\":0},\"fr\":{\"href\":\"/fr/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"de\":{\"href\":\"/de/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"it\":{\"href\":\"/it/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"jp\":{\"href\":\"/ja/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"es\":{\"href\":\"/es/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"ko\":{\"href\":\"/ko/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"cn\":{\"href\":\"/zh-CN/settings\",\"matchLevel\":1},\"zh-Hant\":{\"href\":\"/zh-TW/settings\",\"matchLevel