ame globs are supported only in the tool position after a literal `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mcp__\u003cserver\u003e__`}),` prefix, such as `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mcp__github__get_*`}),`; the server segment must be glob-free. See `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`#permission-rule-syntax`,children:`Permission rule syntax`}),` below for pattern matching details`]}),_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`[ \"Bash(git diff *)\" ]`})})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`ask`})}),_jsxs(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:[`Array of permission rules to ask for confirmation upon tool use. See `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`#permission-rule-syntax`,children:`Permission rule syntax`}),` below`]}),_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`[ \"Bash(git push *)\" ]`})})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`deny`})}),_jsxs(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:[`Array of permission rules to deny tool use. Use this to exclude sensitive files from Claude Code access. Tool names accept glob patterns: `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`\"*\"`}),` denies every tool and `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`\"mcp__*\"`}),` denies every MCP tool. Deny rules can’t remove `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/en/tools-reference#endconversation-tool-behavior`,children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`EndConversation`})}),` while any other tool remains. See `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`#permission-rule-syntax`,children:`Permission rule syntax`}),` and `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/en/permissions#tool-specific-permission-rules`,children:`Bash permission limitations`})]}),_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`[ \"WebFetch\", \"Bash(curl *)\", \"Read(./.env)