y’s `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`injectHosts`}),`; it requires `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`network.tlsTerminate`}),` and Claude Code v2.1.199 or later. `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mask`}),` entries are only honored from user, managed, or CLI `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`--settings`}),` settings, not from `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`.claude/settings.json`}),` or `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`.claude/settings.local.json`}),`. Arrays are merged across all settings scopes, and `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`deny`}),` takes precedence when the same variable appears with both modes.`]}),_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`[{ \"name\": \"GITHUB_TOKEN\", \"mode\": \"deny\" }]`})})]}),_jsxs(_components.tr,{children:[_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_components.code,{children:`credentials.envVars[].extract`})}),_jsxs(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:[`Regular expression for `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`/en/sandboxing#mask-environment-variables`,children:`structured masking`}),` when `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mode`}),` is `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mask`}),`. Claude Code applies it across the variable’s value and replaces only the text captured by group 1 of each match with a sentinel, so the rest of the value stays parseable, such as the password inside a `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`DATABASE_URL`}),` connection string. Must contain at least one capturing group. Without `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`extract`}),` or `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`decode`}),`, Claude Code replaces the entire value with one sentinel. Can’t be combined with `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`decode`}),`. Accepted but ignored when `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`mode`}),` is `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`deny`}),`. Requires Claude Code v2.1.224 or later.`]}),_jsx(_components.td,{style:{textAlign:`left`},children:_jsx(_compo